# The repo previously held a mix of LF and CRLF source files, so routine edits
# on Windows rewrote whole files and buried real changes in line-ending noise.
# Normalise text to LF in the repository; checkout still respects core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.zip binary
*.wasm binary
